  "body": "It is hard to navigate the [C-S API](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.10/client-server-api/) index. What about collapsing by default any section or subsection with more than a certain number of children? It could be expanded with a click on an arrow, at the right of the subsection header. For example\r\n\r\n```\r\nAPI Standards ▼\r\n\r\n    Standard error response ▼\r\n\r\n        Common error codes\r\n        Other error codes\r\n        Rate limiting\r\n\r\n    Transaction identifiers\r\n```",
